# A favoured-skill success, and the patron's favour either side of it.
# Read by tools/check_favour_awards.sh, bd inc-rgzr.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/lizardfolk-monk-seed1.sav \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/favour-insight.keys 5
#
# Creature::SkillCheck (src/Skills.cpp) pays 10 * (check total - 15) favour to
# every god whose FAVOURED_SKILLS list holds the skill, when the check succeeds
# and a natural 1 would have failed. Xavias lists Knowledge (Theology)
# (lib/religion.irh) and has no EV_CALC_FAVOUR handler, so the sheet prints his
# favour exactly as gainFavour wrote it.
#
# Praying and choosing [i] seek insight (Character::Insight, src/Prayer.cpp)
# rolls Knowledge (Theology) against DC 15 with the roll shown on screen, which
# is what lets the check compute the award it expects from the game's own line.
#
#   w y                  wizard mode, whose menu opens at once.
#   Become Divine        makes Xavias the patron. It sets one sacrifice
#     Champion           category to 30000 (src/Debug.cpp), which is the
#                        starting figure and is not the measurement.
#   d DOWN*20            the character sheet, scrolled to Spiritual State.
#   p i                  pray, seek insight.
#   SPACE n              dismiss the box naming the aid Xavias would give, then
#                        decline "divine insight into your possessions", which
#                        would add an intervention penalty to the favour.
#
# The opening 's' buys the one completed turn without which tools/headless.sh
# reports NO GAMEPLAY; see tools/keys/load-char-sheet.keys.

s
w
@while "Enter wizard mode" y
@until "Wizard Mode Options" w
@choose "Become Divine Champion"
"Xavias"
ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE

d
DOWN*20
@dump:favour-before
ESC

p
@expect "seek insight"
i
@dump:insight
@while "more --" SPACE
@while "would aid you" SPACE
@while "insight into your possessions" n
@while "more --" SPACE

d
DOWN*20
@dump:favour-after
ESC
